WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.600
Narrator: Scene three. A fan in a wheelchair.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:10.500
Faisal: How can I help you? The lifts aren't used now - I'll stay with you.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:13.000
Narrator: Faisal asks first, explains the lifts aren't used, stays with him - and gives his supervisor the exact location.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.200
Faisal: Sierra 2, Marshal 22. Fan in a wheelchair with one companion, Block C upper concourse by lift 3. Taking them to the refuge point. Over.

